; RtfFOTBuilder — the `-t rtf` backend (Stage 6a step 3). Ported from
; ~/repos/dazzle/jade/RtfFOTBuilder.cxx (C++ oracle; C# mirror
; openjade-net/src/OpenJade/Jade/RtfFOTBuilder.cs). Design note: DESIGN.md
; "RtfFOTBuilder (`-t rtf`) — design note (2026-07-29)".
;
; Architecture mirror: the body accumulates in a temp byte buffer (the
; reference TmpOutputByteStream collapses to one Array[u8] — no
; output-observable blocking); finish() renders the prolog (fonttbl in
; OpenSP HashTable iteration order, colortbl, stylesheet) and copies the
; body patching INSERTION_CHAR ('\0' + 'b' + two big-endian words) into
; bookmark start/end pairs for referenced elements. Character formatting is
; DELTA-encoded (sync_char_format diffs spec against output state); fonts
; and colors are numbered in first-use order. The engine runs at
; units-per-inch 1440 (twips) under this backend.
;
; NOT ported (unreachable through our engine — it has no math/grid FO
; classes): the EQ-field math family, grids, ReorderFlowObject; WIN32 OLE
; object embedding (the mac reference binary compiles it out). initJIS
; (JIS0208 doublebyte rows) is deferred until a corpus document contains
; CJK — a LOUD stderr note marks any doublebyte fallback taken. Known
; stderr deviation: includePicture does not attempt to open the graphic
; file, so a MISSING figure produces no "cannot open" message (the RTF
; bytes are identical either way; measured runs have the figures).
;
; Port/connection capture happens at the FotSink seam as a recorded-call
; queue (SaveFOTBuilder.scaly) — replay re-issues the calls against the
; live delta state, so this sink needs no capture machinery of its own.
;
; RBMM: all builder state lives on the sink's own page. Format stacks are
; arrays of page-hosted records with slot reuse (depth cursors), so
; allocation is bounded by maximum nesting depth, not push count.

use scaly.memory.Page
use scaly.containers.Array
use scaly.containers.String.String
use opensp.StringC.StringC
use dazzle.Grove.GroveNode
use dazzle.Grove.GroveInfo
use dazzle.ELObj.ELObj
use dazzle.ELObj.GlyphSubstTableRec
use dazzle.Style.InheritedC
use dazzle.Style.LengthSpec
use dazzle.Style.FotSym
use dazzle.Style.DisplaySpace
use dazzle.Style.DisplayNIC
use dazzle.Style.RuleNIC
use dazzle.Style.LinkNIC
use dazzle.Style.ExternalGraphicNIC
use dazzle.Style.LeaderNIC
use dazzle.Style.BoxNIC
use dazzle.Style.ScoreNIC
use dazzle.Style.TableNIC
use dazzle.Style.TableColumnNIC
use dazzle.Style.TableCellNIC
use dazzle.Style.CharacterNIC
use dazzle.Style.AnchorNIC
use dazzle.Style.GlyphAnnotationNIC
use dazzle.Style.EmphasizingMarkNIC
use dazzle.Style.GridNIC
use dazzle.Style.GridCellNIC
use dazzle.Style.EmbeddedTextNIC
use dazzle.Style.IncludedContainerAreaNIC
use dazzle.Style.MultiModeRec
use dazzle.Style.MultiModeNIC
use dazzle.Interpreter.Interpreter
use dazzle.InterpreterMessages.InterpreterMessages

